        "text": "$\\frac12$"
      },
      {
        "key": "C",
        "text": "$\\frac59$"
      },
      {
        "key": "D",
        "text": "$\\frac23$"
      },
      {
        "key": "E",
        "text": "$\\frac56$"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Count the faces",
        "body": "Each picture shows three faces that meet at a corner. The first picture shows YES, YES and maybe; the second shows no, no and YES — so the second picture shows the three faces we could not see in the first (it cannot show the maybe face or two of the YES faces again). Altogether the six faces are: YES three times, no twice and maybe once.\n\n$$P(\\text{YES}) = \\frac36 = \\frac12.$$\n\n**Answer: (B) $\\frac12$**"
      }
    ],
